+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""Momentum holding-period robustness test.
+
+This test addresses the primary question:
+  "Does the qualified momentum effect survive a small predeclared holding-period 
+   variation without becoming a single-point timing artifact?"
+
+Scope:
+- Fixed lookback-5 momentum signal (using momentum_signals with lookback=5)
+- 10-asset universe (using uniform_regime_assets)
+- Small holding-period grid (predeclared before execution)
+- Walk-forward/null methodology as per research/METHODOLOGY.md
+- No post-inspection tuning of lookback or holding period
+
+Evidence gate: The holding-period sensitivity is classified and any positive finding
+is independently verifiable.
 """
